WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:11.131 --> 00:00:13.381
(applause)

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.920
- [Narrator] In Finland,
there is a punk band

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.160
that marches to the beat of its own riot.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.154
- We're PK and we love punk.

00:00:23.154 --> 00:00:25.463
- [Narrator] Pertti Kurikan
Nimipaivat has been around

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:27.623
as a band for over eight years.

00:00:27.623 --> 00:00:31.623
And in 2016, these rock
stars decided this will be

00:00:31.623 --> 00:00:35.071
their last year performing together.

00:00:35.071 --> 00:00:36.738
This is their story.

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:15.042
(upbeat punk music)

00:01:23.642 --> 00:01:27.392
♫ No no no no no no no no no

